{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cat City, where Throy\u2019s story takes place, a dreamless yellow cat whose self-discovery journey you\u2019ll follow throughout the game as he tries to find a dream to pursue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City: A Story About Dreams is a modern Point N\u2019 Click game with Visual Novel elements. It\u2019s a calm, relaxing and cheerful experience, perfect for those who wish to step away from reality but are not into the popular and extremely frenetic games from nowadays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the usual Point N\u2019 Click mechanics, you\u2019ll also find: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames throughout your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City will soon come out to PC and mobile devices.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159140?t=1771130343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771130343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159140/0634ad4911ef109adab85fe11cd2bed848018c0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771130343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159140/0634ad4911ef109adab85fe11cd2bed848018c0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771130343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cat City, where Throy\u2019s story takes place, a dreamless yellow cat whose self-discovery journey you\u2019ll follow throughout the game as he tries to find a dream to pursue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City: A Story About Dreams is a modern Point N\u2019 Click game with Visual Novel elements. It\u2019s a calm, relaxing and cheerful experience, perfect for those who wish to step away from reality but are not into the popular and extremely frenetic games from nowadays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the usual Point N\u2019 Click mechanics, you\u2019ll also find: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames throughout your journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat City will soon come out to PC and mobile devices.</p>","developers":["Instal Entretenimento"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159140/584539c0f08aa621cd70faca7afe7da8305d5461/header.jpg?t=1771130343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3159140/1428828645/d4b81a7573fc05fb57797bc1e12b9fefd271e07a/1771129760/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771130341","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3159140/1428828645/d4b81a7573fc05fb57797bc1e12b9fefd271e07a/1771129760/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771130341","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3159140/1428828645/d4b81a7573fc05fb57797bc1e12b9fefd271e07a/1771129760/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771130341","id":257287418,"name":"Cat City- Trailer Beta","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257287418/f9e35d68bde753e22a238e1bfe76af4063de7383/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771130341"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr